      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260717/202607170401007401_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260717/202607170401007401_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260717/202607170401007401_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯动态】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-18/6a5a518c96f87native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">并非30分钟！官方：世界杯决赛中场休息17分钟以内，演出占11分钟</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/6a2aff55a702b.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/6a2aff55a702b.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/6a2aff55a702b.jpg"> </div><p>据《马卡报》报道，赛事主办方称，世界杯决赛中场休息时长不会超过17分钟。也就是说，仅比常规足球比赛的中场休息时间多两分钟。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-18/6a5a566f138b4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：齐达内本月与法国正式签约 将率队征战2030年世界杯</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180021195808_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180021195808_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180021195808_720.jpg"> </div><p>记者罗马诺以here we go确认，齐达内将成为下一任法国队主帅，这个决定从去年敲定后一直没有疑问。齐达内已经确定教练组人员，合同将在本月正式签署。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-18/6a5aaf9d22c1fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">特朗普：应该再次选择美国办世界杯，因凡蒂诺说未来可以中美合办</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.83" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180658256151.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.83" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.83" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180658256151_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180658256151_720.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯决赛将于北京时间7月20日凌晨3点打响。赛前，美国总统特朗普在在世界杯决赛前的国际足联招待会上发表讲话，表示希望美国再次被选择作为世界杯的主办国。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-18/6a5aa9a268963native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">德拉富恩特：能进决赛已是荣幸 梅西是伟大天才亚马尔必须做自己</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.48" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180616121822.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.48" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.48" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180616121822_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180616121822_720.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯决赛，西班牙vs阿根廷赛前，德拉富恩特出席新闻发布会，接受一系列记者提问。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-18/6a5aa24ee3b19native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗德里：梅西是GOAT但对手远不止有他 阿根廷是近年状态最佳队伍</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.46" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180552011717.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.46" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.46" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180552011717_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180552011717_720.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯决赛，西班牙vs阿根廷赛前，罗德里出席新闻发布会。接受记者一系列提问。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-18/6a5a92f45705fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">拉波尔特：不怕侵略性，但阿根廷有很多小动作，必须管控这些行为</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180440547404.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180440547404.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180440547404.jpg"> </div><p>拉波尔特在西班牙对阵阿根廷赛前接受马卡报采访，其中，他被问到了关于阿根廷的比赛风格，是否对于对手的侵略性感到担忧。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-18/6a5aa225d60b1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">FIFA实力榜：姆总进攻第1 梅西创造力升5名第1 西班牙包揽防守前3</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180555032322.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180555032322.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180555032322.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯半决赛结束，FIFA官方更新实力排行榜，三个关键表现维度中，进攻维度姆巴佩仍居第一；创造力维度，梅西连升5名现居第一，防守维度排名前3的球员都来自西班牙。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-18/6a5a62d043f03native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">还有两天决赛！记者：空气烂透了 嘴里都是烟味，天空都看不见</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.33" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260718/202607180117525869.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.33" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.33" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260718/202607180117525869.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260718/202607180117525869.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯决赛将在北京时间20日03:00进行。记者Nico Cantor报道，目前当地的空气情况很糟糕。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-18/6a5a7c407493bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">延续决赛传统！罗马诺：阿根廷西班牙世界杯决赛同穿主场球衣</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180306537534.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180306537534_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180306537534_720.jpg"> </div><p>据罗马诺消息，阿根廷与西班牙都将在世界杯决赛中身穿主场球衣。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-18/6a5a6cf28d0fcnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TyC：蒙铁尔和冈萨雷斯有望在决赛首发，小西蒙尼或替补待命</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.51" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260607/6a24e8ccefb95.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.51" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.51" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260607/6a24e8ccefb95.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260607/6a24e8ccefb95.jpg"> </div><p>据阿根廷媒体TyC体育报道，凭借对阵英格兰一役中替补登场后的亮眼表现，尼科·冈萨雷斯和蒙铁尔极有希望被主教练斯卡洛尼写进世界杯决赛的阿根廷队首发名单。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-18/6a5a7f92b46d4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">冲金靴！法媒：姆巴佩季军赛将首发，要为德尚谢幕赢球并争夺金靴</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/6a501e1fbb06b_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/6a501e1fbb06b.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/6a501e1fbb06b.jpg"> </div><p>据法国媒体CANAL+ Foot消息，尽管德尚已计划安排轮换，姆巴佩预计仍将在对阵英格兰的比赛中首发。</p><p><strong>【其他新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-17/6a5a487814b40native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">5月率队击败韩国夺冠！中国足协官方：大卫不再担任U16国足主帅</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/6a165f260017d_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/6a165f260017d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/6a165f260017d.jpg"> </div><p>中国足协官方消息，大卫·阿尔马赞不再担任U16国足主帅。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-18/6a5a5f665bfe3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">世界杯4场3球2助！官方：维拉签瑞士国脚曼赞比 转会费超6000万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180103598752_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180103598752_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607180103598752_1280.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，阿斯顿维拉签下瑞士国脚曼赞比，将身披44号。此前据罗马诺报道，转会费超6000万欧。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-18/6a5a5f07e376cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：萨拉赫加盟贝西克塔斯达协议，年薪约1000万欧+200万欧奖金</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.co